sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant B as Browser (Next.js web)
    participant N as nginx (/api/ → api:3000)
    participant C as AuthController
    participant S as AuthService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    B->>N: POST /auth/login {email, password} (Origin checked)
    N->>C: forward
    C->>S: login(email, password)
    S->>DB: SELECT users WHERE email = normalized
    DB-->>S: user row (status active, passwordHash)
    S->>S: bcrypt.compare
    S->>DB: INSERT auth_sessions (refreshTokenHash SHA-256, expiresAt)
    S-->>C: { user, accessToken {sub,sid}, refreshToken, csrfToken }
    C-->>B: 200 + Set-Cookie x3 (httpOnly access_token, httpOnly refresh_token path=/api/v1/auth, csrf_token)

    opt Refresh rotation
        B->>C: POST /auth/refresh (refresh_token + CSRF, repair-only CSRF)
        C->>S: verify refresh token → session lookup
        S->>S: strict one-time rotation (no grace window), lineage on reuse
        S->>DB: UPDATE revoked_at = now() WHERE id = ? AND revoked_at IS NULL
        S->>DB: INSERT successor session (rotated_from_sid)
        C-->>B: rotated access + refresh cookies
    end